">was </span><span begin="00:56.490" end="00:56.830">dead</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.010" end="01:00.280"><span begin="00:59.010" end="00:59.080">My </span><span begin="00:59.080" end="00:59.430">life </span><span begin="00:59.430" end="00:59.620">is </span><span begin="00:59.620" end="00:59.670">a </span><span begin="00:59.670" end="01:00.280">mess</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.680" end="01:10.130"><span begin="01:01.680" end="01:01.710">I </span><span begin="01:01.710" end="01:01.850">love </span><span begin="01:01.850" end="01:08.350">it </span><span begin="01:08.350" end="01:08.930">even </span><span begin="01:08.930" end="01:09.140">though </span><span begin="01:09.140" end="01:09.320">I'm </span><span begin="01:09.320" end="01:10.130">depressed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.200" end="01:14.590"><span begin="01:12.200" end="01:12.510">Only </span><span begin="01:12.510" end="01:12.740">call </span><span begin="01:12.740" end="01:12.950">it </span><span begin="01:12.950" end="01:12.980">a </span><span begin="01:12.980" end="01:13.340">living </span><span begin="01:13.340" end="01:13.560">'cause </span><span begin="01:13.560" end="01:13.650">I'm </span><span begin="01:13.650" end="01:13.980">still </span><span begin="01:13.980" end="01:14.590">alive</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.070" end="01:18.080"><span begin="01:15.070" end="01:15.440">Only </span><span begin="01:15.440" end="01:15.820">open </span><span begin="01:15.820" end="01:15.990">up </span><span begin="01:15.990" end="01:16.170">the </span><span begin="01:16.170" end="01:16.640">doors </span><span begin="01:16.640" end="01:16.790">if </span><span begin="01:16.790" end="01:16.900">they're </span><span begin="01:16.900" end="01:17.820">suicide </span><span begin="01:17.820" end="01:18.080">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.400" end="01:21.010"><span begin="01:18.400" end="01:18.610">I'm </span><span begin="01:18.610" end="01:18.990">anxious </spa