end="01:28.780">of </span><span begin="01:28.780" end="01:28.910">my </span><span begin="01:28.910" end="01:29.300">brain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.620" end="01:32.690"><span begin="01:29.620" end="01:29.750">I </span><span begin="01:29.750" end="01:29.960">might </span><span begin="01:29.960" end="01:30.260">fill </span><span begin="01:30.260" end="01:30.450">up </span><span begin="01:30.450" end="01:30.590">all </span><span begin="01:30.590" end="01:30.860">the </span><span begin="01:30.860" end="01:31.400">emptiness </span><span begin="01:31.400" end="01:31.600">with </span><span begin="01:31.600" end="01:32.020">diamonds </span><span begin="01:32.020" end="01:32.160">and </span><span begin="01:32.160" end="01:32.690">chains</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.690" end="01:35.880"><span begin="01:32.690" end="01:32.870">And </span><span begin="01:32.870" end="01:33.050">if </span><span begin="01:33.050" end="01:33.300">you </span><span begin="01:33.300" end="01:33.590">wanna </span><span begin="01:33.590" end="01:33.810">get </span><span begin="01:33.810" end="01:33.890">to </span><span begin="01:33.890" end="01:34.420">steppin' </span><span begin="01:34.420" end="01:34.600">you'll </span><span begin="01:34.600" end="01:34.820">get </span><span begin="01:34.820" end="01:35.170">punched </span><span begin="01:35.170" end="01:35.270">in </span><span begin="01:35.270" end="01:35.350">the </span><span begin="01:35.350" end="01:35.880">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.040" end="01:37.370"><span begin="01:36.040" end="01:36.240">But </span><span begin="01:36.240" end="01:36.550">it's </span><span begin="01:36.550" end="01:37.370">alright</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.020" end="01:39.310"><span begin="01:38.020" end="01:38.080">I'm </span><span begin="01:38.080" end="01:38.360">caught </span><span begin="01:38.360" end="01:38.450">on </span><span begin="01:38.450" end="01:38.610">the </span><span begin="01:38.610" end="01:39.310">fence</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.030" end="01:42.490"><span begin="01:40.030" end="01:40.160">I'm </span><span begin="01:40.160" end="01:40.390">either </span><span begin="01:40.390" end="01:41.030">happy </span><span begin="01:41.030" end="01:41.230">or </span><span begin="01:41.230" end="01:41.340">I </span><span begin="01:41.340" end="01:41.600">wish </span><span begin="01:41.600" end="01:41.730">I </span><span begin="01:41.730" end="01:41.910">was </span><span begin="01:41.910" end="01:42.490">dead</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.520" end="01:45.670"><span begin="01:42.520" end="01:44.410">My </span><span begin="01:44.410" end="01:44.840">life </span><span begin="01:44.840" end="01:45.040">is </span><span begin="01:45.040" end="01:45.120">a </span><span begin="01:45.120" end="01:45.670">mess</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.380" end="01:48.870"><span begin="01:46.380" end="01:46.470">I </span><span begin="01:46.470" end="01:46.910">kinda </span><span begin="01:46.910" end="01:47.250">like </span><span begin="01:47.250" end="01:47.430">it </span><span begin="01:47.430" end="01:47.850">even </span><span begin="01:47.850" end="01:48.070">though </span><span begin="01:48.070" end="01:48.220">I'm </span><span begin="01:48.220" end="01:48.870">depressed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.620" end="01:52.240"><span begin="01:49.620" end="01:50.880">I'm </span><span begin="01:50.880" end="01:51.320">caught </span><span begin="01:51.320" end="01:51.460">on </span><span begin="01:51.460" end="01:51.560">the </span><span begin="01:51.560" end="01:52.240">fence</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.010" end="01:55.220"><span begin="01:53.010" end="01:53.120">I'm </span><span begin="01:53.120" end="01:53.350">either </span><span begin="01:53.350" end="01:53.970">happy </span><span begin="01:53.970" end="01:54.180">or </span><span begin="01:54.180" end="01:54.280">I </span><span begin="01:54.280" end="01:54.570">wish </span><span be